<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HMT Technology raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HMT Technology raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it upgraded HMT Technology Corp to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, HMT posted first quarter earnings of $0.31 per diluted share, down from $0.36 a share a year ago. HMT had more shares outstanding during the current second quarter than last year.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- HMT gained 11/16 to 16-11/16.</p>
